  "description": "\"There aren't two suns in the sky... or are there?!\"\n\nOn his first day as a transfer student, the tennis genius \"Kang San\" who has drawn the attention of the world meets \"Joo Shin-ee\" who plays tennis as a hobby.\n\nWhat began as a light-hearted request for a match ends with the first humiliating defeat for \"Kang San\".   \nAnd with that \"Kang San\", who had been maintaining an undefeated streak thanks to his natural-born talent, had his puffed-up pride completely deflated.\n\nThe power player \"Kang San\" who uses his strength and speed to crush opponents!  \nAnd \"Joo Shin-ee\" who uses his resourcefulness and control to exploit his opponents' weak point!\n\nTwo very different kind of geniuses have met!  \nWho will come out the victor in their match \"1 year later\"?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EB%84%88%EB%AF%B8/1361), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61641089)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/19141), [French](https://fr.piccoma.com/fr/product/632)",
